%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76e4184f73747b54aa1a77b55363464a, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 426762240
    m_Localized: All right, let's begin the Game Planning & Development Club game
      jam.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539456
    m_Localized: Let's do this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539457
    m_Localized: Looking forward to working with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539458
    m_Localized: N-Nice to meet you all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539459
    m_Localized: Looking forward to it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539460
    m_Localized: All right, let's start with introductions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539461
    m_Localized: I'll be leading the team this time. It's my first time as leader,
      so I'm a little nervous. Nice to meet you all. Oh, and I'm a third-year student.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539462
    m_Localized: I'm Ryuta, a second-year student! I love making brutally hard action
      games! Nice to meet you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539463
    m_Localized: I'm Got, a third-year. I'll be programming, same as Ryuta. 'Sup.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539464
    m_Localized: I'm Milu, a first-year. Um, I'll be doing the art. Please go easy
      on me...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539465
    m_Localized: I'm Kashiwamochi, a first-year. I'll be handling sound. I'll do
      my very best.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539466
    m_Localized: First, let's quickly go over how this game jam will work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539467
    m_Localized: We have today and today only, and we'll be working online.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539468
    m_Localized: Working remotely is kind of a pain...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539469
    m_Localized: That... can't be helped.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539470
    m_Localized: We'll start with a planning meeting, then everyone will work on
      their own tasks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539471
    m_Localized: Let's do our best to get it into a genuinely playable state.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539472
    m_Localized: So, about the game we're making today...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539473
    m_Localized: I was thinking we'd make an action game. What do you all think?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539474
    m_Localized: Are we really deciding the genre right off the bat?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539475
    m_Localized: A lot of people said they wanted to make an action game in the team
      survey.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539476
    m_Localized: Yes! My specialty!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539477
    m_Localized: I see.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539478
    m_Localized: Does that work for you, Milu and Kashiwamochi?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539479
    m_Localized: It should... probably.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539480
    m_Localized: Sure, that's fine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539481
    m_Localized: Then let's start working out the details.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539482
    m_Localized: First, I want us all on the same page about the setting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539483
    m_Localized: (Who should I ask?)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539484
    m_Localized: Got, do you have any ideas?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539485
    m_Localized: Huh, me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539486
    m_Localized: Yeah. You know, since you have a lot of development experience.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539487
    m_Localized: No, I'm good. Why not ask the younger members? Besides, I prefer
      overall architecture and putting specs together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539488
    m_Localized: Oh, right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539489
    m_Localized: Ryuta, do you have any ideas?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539490
    m_Localized: Huh? Me?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539491
    m_Localized: Yeah. You said action games were your specialty, so I wanted your
      take.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539492
    m_Localized: Let's see... Something like Oyaji Brothers might be easy to make.
      I want to build traps, so how about a cave setting?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539493
    m_Localized: I see... Got it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539494
    m_Localized: Kashiwamochi, do you have any ideas?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539495
    m_Localized: Hmm... I usually just tailor my work to whatever I'm asked for...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539496
    m_Localized: Are there any kinds of music you're particularly good or bad at?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539497
    m_Localized: Oh, making something orchestral could be fun. Electronic sounds
      aren't really my forte.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539498
    m_Localized: An orchestra, huh...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539499
    m_Localized: Milu, do you have any ideas?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539500
    m_Localized: M-Me...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539501
    m_Localized: Yeah. Like what kind of action game you'd want to make.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539502
    m_Localized: Action games really aren't my area of expertise...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539503
    m_Localized: I see.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539504
    m_Localized: Then how about we base it on a conventional side-scrolling action
      game?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539505
    m_Localized: I think that sounds good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539506
    m_Localized: In that case, I'll assign tasks to our two programmers first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539507
    m_Localized: I've been waiting for this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539508
    m_Localized: First, we need to divide up the roles...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539509
    m_Localized: Ryuta, you handle system design. Got, you take content.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539510
    m_Localized: Huh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539511
    m_Localized: Huh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539512
    m_Localized: Was that a bad call?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539513
    m_Localized: No, it's not bad, but...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539514
    m_Localized: I don't know if I can handle the design...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539515
    m_Localized: I think we'd be better off switching those around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539516
    m_Localized: Oh. Sorry...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539517
    m_Localized: Got, you handle system design. Ryuta, you take content.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539518
    m_Localized: Leave it to me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539519
    m_Localized: Am I free to decide all the development rules too?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539520
    m_Localized: Yeah. You two are the only programmers, so talk it over and use
      whatever works best for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539521
    m_Localized: Um... If you have any requests...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539522
    m_Localized: Requests, huh...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539523
    m_Localized: I honestly don't have any, and I don't really understand this stuff,
      so I'll leave it all to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539524
    m_Localized: ...Okay.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539525
    m_Localized: We don't know how many traps or bosses we'll end up with, so I'd
      like a design that can scale as much as possible.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539526
    m_Localized: Is this game really going to be that big?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539527
    m_Localized: No, we can't make it that big, but it could change depending on
      how ambitious Ryuta gets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539528
    m_Localized: Makes sense. Got it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539529
    m_Localized: I just want to know where we should put the assets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539530
    m_Localized: Just paste them straight into the chat like usual.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539531
    m_Localized: Won't that clutter up the chat?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539532
    m_Localized: Oh, then let's use Golegole Cloud.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539533
    m_Localized: I'll make a folder in the account our club uses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539534
    m_Localized: Got it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539535
    m_Localized: Is there anything you want to do, Got?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539536
    m_Localized: Nothing in particular. More than anything, I want to make something
      that actually works as a game.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539537
    m_Localized: Oh, right. How often would progress updates work best for you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539538
    m_Localized: I'll go with whatever works for everyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539539
    m_Localized: Then...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539540
    m_Localized: We're short on time, so we don't need progress updates, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539541
    m_Localized: No, that's a little too...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539542
    m_Localized: You think so?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539543
    m_Localized: The design is simple because it's a game jam. That also means there's
      no room to recover if things go wrong.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539544
    m_Localized: Oh. Then make the design completely airtight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539545
    m_Localized: That's not quite what I meant...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539546
    m_Localized: Let's do a quick update every hour.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539547
    m_Localized: Yeah, that sounds about right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539548
    m_Localized: I want you to check in with Ryuta more often than that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539549
    m_Localized: That's the plan. I'll leave the artist and sound designer to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539550
    m_Localized: Let's meet every twenty minutes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539551
    m_Localized: ...Isn't that a little too often?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539552
    m_Localized: Huh? You think so?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539553
    m_Localized: Yeah. We'd constantly have to stop working.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539554
    m_Localized: Well, you can never have too much communication, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539555
    m_Localized: R-Right...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539556
    m_Localized: Next up is Ryuta...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539557
    m_Localized: What should I start with?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539558
    m_Localized: You have quite a bit of freedom. What do you want to start with?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539559
    m_Localized: Gotcha traps.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539560
    m_Localized: I thought so.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539561
    m_Localized: In that case...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539562
    m_Localized: You can make as many traps as you want.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539563
    m_Localized: Really?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539564
    m_Localized: We need ideas for the stage layout anyway.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539565
    m_Localized: Well...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539566
    m_Localized: Did I say something wrong...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539567
    m_Localized: Won't that work our artist to death?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539568
    m_Localized: Well... yes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539569
    m_Localized: Oh, good point...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539570
    m_Localized: It's fine! I'll draw them myself!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539571
    m_Localized: Huh? Oh, uh... really...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539572
    m_Localized: Then... sure, I guess...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539573
    m_Localized: I'd like you to build the stage first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539574
    m_Localized: The stage?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539575
    m_Localized: Yeah. I want you to plan what kind of stage you want so our artist
      knows exactly what assets to make.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539576
    m_Localized: That makes sense. Got it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539577
    m_Localized: Could you wait for Got's instructions?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539578
    m_Localized: So I can take a break until Got tells me what to do?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539579
    m_Localized: I guess so, yes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539580
    m_Localized: You can't do much until the design is finished.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539581
    m_Localized: I'll finish it as quickly as I can.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539582
    m_Localized: Understood.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539583
    m_Localized: Oh, before you start on the traps, can I put you in charge of the
      player's basic controls?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539584
    m_Localized: Got it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539585
    m_Localized: Got can expand the controls beyond walking later.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539586
    m_Localized: Got it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539587
    m_Localized: Next is the level design...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539588
    m_Localized: I think I'd like to leave that to you, Ryuta.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539589
    m_Localized: That makes sense. Then...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539590
    m_Localized: Let's try making it at whatever difficulty you like, Ryuta!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539591
    m_Localized: Wait, really?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539592
    m_Localized: Well... um... sure...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539593
    m_Localized: Huh? Was that a bad idea?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539594
    m_Localized: I'll give it everything I've got!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539595
    m_Localized: ...Right... sure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539596
    m_Localized: For now, let's make it easy enough for anyone to beat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539597
    m_Localized: Yeah, that would make it more accessible.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539598
    m_Localized: Let's make it brutally hard so it leaves an impression.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539599
    m_Localized: If it's hard just for the sake of it, it might feel unfair.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539600
    m_Localized: Next, let's assign the artist's tasks related to Ryuta's work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539601
    m_Localized: Okay.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539602
    m_Localized: I'm thinking of using a tile-based system. Can you picture that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539603
    m_Localized: You mean like putting different blocks together, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539604
    m_Localized: Exactly. Hand-crafting every stage would make the workload explode
      every time we added one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539605
    m_Localized: Understood.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539606
    m_Localized: So, about the stage assets for now...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539607
    m_Localized: It'll be a lot of work, so free assets are fine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539608
    m_Localized: Oh, are you sure?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539609
    m_Localized: Yeah. There are going to be a ton of them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539610
    m_Localized: I... see...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539611
    m_Localized: Let's put those off for now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539612
    m_Localized: Huh, is that okay?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539613
    m_Localized: You can't draw anything until Ryuta has a plan. I want you to draw
      the player first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539614
    m_Localized: I see. Understood.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539615
    m_Localized: I'd like you to prepare some placeholder assets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539616
    m_Localized: How detailed should the placeholders be?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539617
    m_Localized: A solid-colored square is fine. Make it 64 by 64 pixels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539618
    m_Localized: Will all the tiles use that size?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539619
    m_Localized: Yes. Please base the player's size on it too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539620
    m_Localized: I'm starting to get the picture. Thank you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539621
    m_Localized: Next, about the player character. Do you have an image you'd like
      to draw?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539622
    m_Localized: The setting isn't settled yet, so I can't really picture anything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539623
    m_Localized: Which is easier for you to draw, a person or an animal?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539624
    m_Localized: A person, definitely. Honestly, I'm not sure I can draw monsters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539625
    m_Localized: I see. We can decide on the monsters later.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539626
    m_Localized: Let's see...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539627
    m_Localized: Ignore the setting for now and draw the player however you like.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539628
    m_Localized: Huh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539629
    m_Localized: We'll have to decide on a story too, so I want you to draw the hero
      you imagine, Milu.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539630
    m_Localized: You mean we'll build the story around the character design?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539631
    m_Localized: Exactly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539632
    m_Localized: Then I'll try doing it my way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539633
    m_Localized: Even a stick figure would be fine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539634
    m_Localized: Really? That's all you need?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539635
    m_Localized: Yeah. You'll have to draw alternate poses too, so it'll be a lot
      of work, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539636
    m_Localized: That's true, but...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539637
    m_Localized: You really can keep it that simple.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539638
    m_Localized: O-Okay...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539639
    m_Localized: Can you draw an explorer-like boy with two alternate poses?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539640
    m_Localized: ...I think I can picture something.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539641
    m_Localized: I'll leave the details to you, but an adventure-style setting should
      make the story easier to develop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539642
    m_Localized: I like that. Understood.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539643
    m_Localized: Finally, Kashiwamochi. Thanks for waiting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539644
    m_Localized: Okay!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539645
    m_Localized: I'd like you to handle the music and sound effects...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539646
    m_Localized: I'd like a tense, adventurous-sounding track.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539647
    m_Localized: Tense, you say?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539648
    m_Localized: I don't know much about music, so I can only describe the mood.
      Can you work with that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539649
    m_Localized: Shouldn't it reflect the game's setting too?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539650
    m_Localized: Keeping the setting consistent matters most, but I thought something
      versatile enough for any stage would be best.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539651
    m_Localized: I see what you mean. All right, I'll give it a try.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539652
    m_Localized: Just... make it sound good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539653
    m_Localized: S-Sound good in what way...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539654
    m_Localized: You know... good!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539655
    m_Localized: Well... okay...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539656
    m_Localized: How about an orchestral piece?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539657
    m_Localized: Oh, that sounds great.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539658
    m_Localized: I want to respect your creative vision, Kashiwamochi.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539659
    m_Localized: Thank you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539660
    m_Localized: You're free to do whatever you like.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539661
    m_Localized: Then there are the sound effects.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539662
    m_Localized: Just tell me what you need and I'll make as many as you want.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539663
    m_Localized: That's really reassuring. In that case...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539664
    m_Localized: Find us some good free sound effects.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539665
    m_Localized: Huh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539666
    m_Localized: Making both the music and the sound effects would be a lot, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539667
    m_Localized: Well, that's true, but...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539668
    m_Localized: It's fine if you cut a few corners on the sound effects.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539669
    m_Localized: Hmm...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539670
    m_Localized: I'd like you to make as many as possible.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539671
    m_Localized: Got it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539672
    m_Localized: Are you sure that's okay? I'm not asking too much?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539673
    m_Localized: Not at all. Leave it to me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539674
    m_Localized: Put your energy into the music. We only need a few sound effects.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539675
    m_Localized: Are you sure?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539676
    m_Localized: Yeah. A few reusable sound effects would be a big help.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539677
    m_Localized: Understood.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539678
    m_Localized: I'm looking forward to your music, Kashiwamochi.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539679
    m_Localized: All right, I think that covers everything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539680
    m_Localized: Yeah, we have a general picture of the development plan now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539681
    m_Localized: I'm going all in on development!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539682
    m_Localized: I'll let you know when the assets are ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539683
    m_Localized: Me too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539684
    m_Localized: Then everyone can get to work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539685
    m_Localized: I've merged the final implementation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539686
    m_Localized: Thanks. I'll make the build, then.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539687
    m_Localized: Oh, is it finally done?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539688
    m_Localized: Yeah. We somehow finished it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539689
    m_Localized: I don't want to look at my drawing tablet for at least a month...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539690
    m_Localized: I might still be a little unsatisfied.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539691
    m_Localized: Then let's do a test playthrough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539692
    m_Localized: The build is ready, so start whenever you like.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539693
    m_Localized: This is... good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539694
    m_Localized: For a one-day game jam, I think this turned out really well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539695
    m_Localized: You look satisfied, Got.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539696
    m_Localized: Well, I'd call it a passing grade.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539697
    m_Localized: I should learn from your drive to aim even higher.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539698
    m_Localized: What did you think after playing it, Milu and Kashiwamochi?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539699
    m_Localized: I'm just glad we had enough assets...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539700
    m_Localized: Oh, that's your takeaway?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539701
    m_Localized: The sound effects were implemented perfectly!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539702
    m_Localized: I'm so glad they came out the way I imagined.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539703
    m_Localized: And... I guess that's that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539704
    m_Localized: Huh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539705
    m_Localized: "What do you mean, \u201Chuh?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539706
    m_Localized: You don't think we're stopping here, do you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539707
    m_Localized: Huh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539708
    m_Localized: It'd be a waste to end it after just one day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539709
    m_Localized: ...You mean...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539710
    m_Localized: Looks like we're continuing development.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539711
    m_Localized: Come on, let's keep at it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539712
    m_Localized: H-Haha...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539713
    m_Localized: ...Is it finished?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539714
    m_Localized: Well, it runs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539715
    m_Localized: Technically, all the assets are there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539716
    m_Localized: The music plays too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539717
    m_Localized: It... kind of looks like a game now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539718
    m_Localized: But what exactly is supposed to be fun about it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539719
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539720
    m_Localized: At some point, everyone just stopped making decisions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539721
    m_Localized: I only drew what I was told to draw...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539722
    m_Localized: And I only made what I was asked to make.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539723
    m_Localized: Nobody did anything wrong.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539724
    m_Localized: But nobody was actually making a game.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539725
    m_Localized: ...I'm sorry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539726
    m_Localized: It can be beaten.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539727
    m_Localized: All the assets are there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539728
    m_Localized: The sound works.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539729
    m_Localized: There are no bugs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539730
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539731
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539732
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539733
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539734
    m_Localized: ...But somehow, it isn't fun.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539735
    m_Localized: "\u201CFinished\u201D and \u201Cfun\u201D are not the same thing."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539736
    m_Localized: You're right...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539737
    m_Localized: Map generator complete.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539738
    m_Localized: I rebuilt the entire system too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539739
    m_Localized: So I don't need to make stages anymore?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539740
    m_Localized: What...? Do I have to redraw everything?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539741
    m_Localized: Do I have to make different music for every stage too?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539742
    m_Localized: W-Wait a second!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539743
    m_Localized: I can make the stages myself...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539744
    m_Localized: No. First, I'm changing the design.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539745
    m_Localized: What...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539746
    m_Localized: We're never going to finish...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539747
    m_Localized: No, we're not going to finish...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539748
    m_Localized: ...Sorry. We're out of time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539749
    m_Localized: ...We went too far.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539750
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539751
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539752
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539753
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539754
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539755
    m_Localized: Well?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539756
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539757
    m_Localized: It's not fun.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539758
    m_Localized: ...Yeah.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539759
    m_Localized: The music feels completely out of place.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539760
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539761
    m_Localized: Delete it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539762
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539763
    m_Localized: Let's delete it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539764
    m_Localized: Oh.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539765
    m_Localized: Wait.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539766
    m_Localized: I die again the instant I restart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539767
    m_Localized: Ah.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539768
    m_Localized: It's a softlock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539769
    m_Localized: It saved right on top of the spikes...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539770
    m_Localized: We accidentally made a horror game where you die forever.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539771
    m_Localized: I didn't see that coming...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539772
    m_Localized: ...This is my fault as the person in charge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539773
    m_Localized: Well... haha...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539774
    m_Localized: Let's add more!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539775
    m_Localized: Then I'll add more characters!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539776
    m_Localized: I'll make three more tracks!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539777
    m_Localized: Sounds great!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539778
    m_Localized: Let's just change the whole spec!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539779
    m_Localized: Huh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539780
    m_Localized: Forget what we just decided! This is no longer a game! It's art!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539781
    m_Localized: That's going a little too far...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539782
    m_Localized: I'm in!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539783
    m_Localized: Let's do it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539784
    m_Localized: Wait, Got...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539785
    m_Localized: Yep. It's too late.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539786
    m_Localized: ...Perfect.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539787
    m_Localized: No bugs!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539788
    m_Localized: We finished all the assets in time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539789
    m_Localized: The music and sound effects are all implemented and checked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539790
    m_Localized: Thank you for checking every last detail!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539791
    m_Localized: They played all the way to the end...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539792
    m_Localized: I'm glad they got to see everything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539793
    m_Localized: This game was genuinely fun from beginning to end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539794
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539795
    m_Localized: Thank you so much, everyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539796
    m_Localized: I had a great time!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539797
    m_Localized: I never knew game jams could be this much fun.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539798
    m_Localized: I'd love to do this again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539799
    m_Localized: ...Yeah.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539800
    m_Localized: Next time, let's make something even better.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539801
    m_Localized: ...Of course!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539802
    m_Localized: Clear!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539803
    m_Localized: Huh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539804
    m_Localized: Huh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539805
    m_Localized: Huh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539806
    m_Localized: A no-save clear?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539807
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539808
    m_Localized: Now that's a developer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539809
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539810
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539811
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539812
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539813
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539814
    m_Localized: This is hopeless.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539815
    m_Localized: You've seen everything there is to see.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539816
    m_Localized: Thank you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539817
    m_Localized: You may already know this, but...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539818
    m_Localized: There is no single right answer in game development.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539819
    m_Localized: No one person is to blame.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539820
    m_Localized: There is no perfect way to give directions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539821
    m_Localized: When it comes to implementation...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539822
    m_Localized: ...or worldbuilding...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539823
    m_Localized: ...there is more than one answer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539824
    m_Localized: And...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539825
    m_Localized: the right answer...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539826
    m_Localized: doesn't belong to you alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539827
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539828
    m_Localized: I think that's all I need to say.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539829
    m_Localized: If you've played this far...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539830
    m_Localized: I'm sure you'll become a great game planner.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539831
    m_Localized: And finally...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539832
    m_Localized: Thank you for playing all the way to the end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539833
    m_Localized: Thank you for playing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539834
    m_Localized: 'Since we have the chance, I''d like to make something incredible
      that we could enter in a contest.

      What do you think?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539835
    m_Localized: 'That''s vague and asking a lot...

      But if we''re doing it,
      I''ll write the code...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539836
    m_Localized: What does everyone else think?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539837
    m_Localized: 'I''m totally on board!

      I''d love to make a near-impossible
      action game packed with instant-death traps.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539838
    m_Localized: 'I''d love to go all out on the presentation...

      With lots
      of animations and effects...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539839
    m_Localized: I might like to layer lots of sounds into a rich orchestral piece.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539840
    m_Localized: I don't have any particular preference, so I'll leave it to everyone
      else.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539841
    m_Localized: Um... I'm just doing sound, so I'll go along with what everyone
      else wants.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539842
    m_Localized: The artist has no particular requests either...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539843
    m_Localized: What do our two programmers think?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539844
    m_Localized: 'If nobody else minds,

      I want to make an action game!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539845
    m_Localized: 'Well, since Ryuta feels that strongly...

      an action game
      sounds fine, doesn''t it?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539846
    m_Localized: 'I''m thinking of making an action game or a shooter.

      What
      do you all think?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539847
    m_Localized: 'That sounds awesome!

      I''m great at making action games!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539848
    m_Localized: What does everyone else think?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539849
    m_Localized: 'A straightforward system shouldn''t be hard to implement,

      so
      why not?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539850
    m_Localized: 'Um... I''m not good at drawing mechanical things...

      If that''s
      okay, then I think it sounds good.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539851
    m_Localized: 'Sure, I think it''s fine.

      Just tell me what mood you want
      for the music and I can make it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539852
    m_Localized: Then we'll go with an action game.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539853
    m_Localized: Next, I'm going to assign everyone their tasks...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539854
    m_Localized: Let's start with Got.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539855
    m_Localized: Oh, me first?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539856
    m_Localized: I want to put you in charge of the design, Got.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539857
    m_Localized: Oh. All right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539858
    m_Localized: Then... (What task should I give him?)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539859
    m_Localized: I'd like you to design the overall structure and show it to me first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539860
    m_Localized: "For now, keep the scope to something like \u201Cplayer controls,
      traps, and one stage.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539861
    m_Localized: I see. A fairly small scope.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539862
    m_Localized: Yeah, and I'd like you to write it up so everyone can refer to it
      later.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539863
    m_Localized: 'Understood.

      I''ll decide the overall structure first and
      work out the details later.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539864
    m_Localized: 'A very rough outline is enough, okay?!

      Whenever I ask you,
      Got, you always obsess over every last detail...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539865
    m_Localized: Well... I'll at least get it to a runnable state for now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539866
    m_Localized: You're seriously good at this...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539867
    m_Localized: I'd like you to put together a quick summary by tomorrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539868
    m_Localized: ...Tomorrow?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539869
    m_Localized: 'Yeah, it can be rough.

      The design will take shape as development
      progresses, right?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539870
    m_Localized: Huh? But... fine, I guess...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539871
    m_Localized: It's just a starting point for now, so I'm counting on you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539872
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539873
    m_Localized: I don't really understand design, so just handle everything for
      now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539874
    m_Localized: ...Everything?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539875
    m_Localized: Yeah. Do whatever you like.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539876
    m_Localized: Uh... right... okay...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539877
    m_Localized: All right, let's begin Spring Minge's first online meeting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539878
    m_Localized: Let's do this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539879
    m_Localized: Looking forward to working with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539880
    m_Localized: N-Nice to meet you all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539881
    m_Localized: Looking forward to it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539882
    m_Localized: All right, let's start with introductions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539883
    m_Localized: 'I''ll be leading the team this time. I''m [name], a third-year
      student.

      It''s my first time as leader, so I''m a little nervous, but
      I look forward to working with you all.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539884
    m_Localized: 'I''m Ryuta, a second-year student.

      Oh, and I''m a programmer.
      My favorite game is Trap Man.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539885
    m_Localized: 'I''m Got, a third-year student.

      I''m a programmer, and I''ll
      be supporting Ryuta.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539886
    m_Localized: 'I-I''m Milu, a first-year student.

      Um, I''m the artist,
      and I''ll d-do my best!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539887
    m_Localized: 'I''m Kashiwamochi, a second-year student.

      Uh, I''ll be doing
      sound. Yep.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539888
    m_Localized: About the schedule going forward...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539889
    m_Localized: 'Based on today''s full-team meeting,

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539890
    m_Localized: please proceed with your individual tasks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539891
    m_Localized: So we won't be meeting in person this time?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539892
    m_Localized: Right. It overlaps with the period when campus is closed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539893
    m_Localized: Oh, because of the entrance exams...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539894
    m_Localized: And there's the graduation ceremony too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539895
    m_Localized: I'm moving back home, so online is my only real option.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539896
    m_Localized: For those reasons, we'll be working online.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539897
    m_Localized: Let's work toward having it ready for the playtesting event.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539898
    m_Localized: So, first I'd like us to decide the general direction for the game
      we're making.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539899
    m_Localized: Um... (How should I bring this up?)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539900
    m_Localized: I'm hungry!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539901
    m_Localized: (stomach growls)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539902
    m_Localized: I want sushi.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539903
    m_Localized: Yo, yo. Got a minute?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539904
    m_Localized: Sure. What's up?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539905
    m_Localized: I hear you guys are making a game right now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539906
    m_Localized: Yeah, for a game jam.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539907
    m_Localized: Then put me in the game! Come on, I'm begging you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539908
    m_Localized: Where did that come from?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539909
    m_Localized: Come on, it'd be great! Make me a secret character or something.
      I love that stuff.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539910
    m_Localized: We have no reason to put you in the game, Daittyan.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539911
    m_Localized: A reason? Because I want to be in it. Checkmate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539912
    m_Localized: That doesn't prove anything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539913
    m_Localized: "What?! Fine, an enemy works too. When you beat me, I'll say, \u201CNot
      bad!\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539914
    m_Localized: That's not something the one who lost would say.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539915
    m_Localized: Sweat the small stuff and you'll go bald, man. I've already figured
      out my character concept.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539916
    m_Localized: I didn't ask, but let's hear it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539917
    m_Localized: The ultimate helper character. Maxed-out attack, infinite health,
      and the moment I show up, you win.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539918
    m_Localized: You'd completely break the game!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539919
    m_Localized: Overpowered characters are the dream, right? Obviously!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539920
    m_Localized: I might consider putting you on a poster in the background.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539921
    m_Localized: Seriously? Yes! I'll send you a photo. I'll pick the most flattering
      one, so just you wait!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539922
    m_Localized: I never said we'd use an actual photo of you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539923
    m_Localized: Come on... Give a guy a break. Let me know if I make the cut, okay?
      I'm counting on you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539924
    m_Localized: Sure, sure. I'll add you if we have time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539925
    m_Localized: Do you have any old Java exams?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539926
    m_Localized: Nope.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539927
    m_Localized: Seriously?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539928
    m_Localized: Did you solve Ex8?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539929
    m_Localized: Do you want the answer?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539930
    m_Localized: Please.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539931
    m_Localized: Here you go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539932
    m_Localized: I don't think it's wrong, at least.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539933
    m_Localized: Isn't there some unrelated file mixed in here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539934
    m_Localized: Oh.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539935
    m_Localized: Well, don't worry about it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539936
    m_Localized: Now I'm curious.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539937
    m_Localized: There's nothing in there I mind you seeing, so it's fine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539938
    m_Localized: You're really okay with that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539939
    m_Localized: By the way, what is this file?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539940
    m_Localized: A design template for game development. It has a README with development
      rules and stuff. I wonder why it's in there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539941
    m_Localized: Beats me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539942
    m_Localized: Kashiwamochi.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539943
    m_Localized: '?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539944
    m_Localized: I heard you're exhibiting at the upcoming Nanpo indie event.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539945
    m_Localized: That's right. Are you interested?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539946
    m_Localized: Let me buy one of your CDs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539947
    m_Localized: Thank you for your business.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539948
    m_Localized: Japanese-style orchestral music really is great.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539949
    m_Localized: It's my specialty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539950
    m_Localized: (with an image) Is this yours, Milu?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539951
    m_Localized: It is. Was it in the clubroom?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539952
    m_Localized: Yeah. You've already gone home, right? Is it okay if I leave it
      in the clubroom?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539953
    m_Localized: It would help if you could hide it on the bookshelf.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539954
    m_Localized: Hide it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539955
    m_Localized: I don't really want anyone to see it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539956
    m_Localized: Got it. I'll put it on the art team's shelf.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539957
    m_Localized: Thank you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539958
    m_Localized: We're playing Nupratune. Want to join?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539959
    m_Localized: Nupra! Sounds good!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539960
    m_Localized: Tomorrow night at nine!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539961
    m_Localized: Gotcha.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539962
    m_Localized: Also, the co-op action game H.E.P.O. has a major update coming.
      Want to play?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539963
    m_Localized: H.E.P.O.? Never heard of it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539964
    m_Localized: It's seriously fun.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539965
    m_Localized: If an action-game fan like you recommends it, it must be good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539966
    m_Localized: I highly recommend it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539967
    m_Localized: Bought it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539968
    m_Localized: You're a legend!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539969
    m_Localized: This is... good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539970
    m_Localized: For a one-day game jam, I think this turned out really well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539971
    m_Localized: You look satisfied, Got.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539972
    m_Localized: Well, I'd call it a passing grade.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539973
    m_Localized: I should learn from your drive to aim even higher.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539974
    m_Localized: What did you think after playing it, Milu and Kashiwamochi?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539975
    m_Localized: I'm just glad we had enough assets...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539976
    m_Localized: Oh, that's your takeaway?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539977
    m_Localized: The sound effects were implemented perfectly!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539978
    m_Localized: I'm so glad they came out the way I imagined.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539979
    m_Localized: And... I guess that's that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539980
    m_Localized: Huh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539981
    m_Localized: "What do you mean, \u201Chuh?\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539982
    m_Localized: You don't think we're stopping here, do you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539983
    m_Localized: Huh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539984
    m_Localized: It'd be a waste to end it after just one day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539985
    m_Localized: ...You mean...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539986
    m_Localized: Looks like we're continuing development.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539987
    m_Localized: Come on, let's keep at it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539988
    m_Localized: H-Haha...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539989
    m_Localized: ...Is it finished?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539990
    m_Localized: Well, it runs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539991
    m_Localized: Technically, all the assets are there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539992
    m_Localized: The music plays too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539993
    m_Localized: It... kind of looks like a game now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539994
    m_Localized: But what exactly is supposed to be fun about it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539995
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539996
    m_Localized: At some point, everyone just stopped making decisions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539997
    m_Localized: I only drew what I was told to draw...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539998
    m_Localized: And I only made what I was asked to make.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443539999
    m_Localized: Nobody did anything wrong.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540000
    m_Localized: But nobody was actually making a game.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540001
    m_Localized: ...I'm sorry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540002
    m_Localized: It can be beaten.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540003
    m_Localized: All the assets are there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540004
    m_Localized: The sound works.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540005
    m_Localized: There are no bugs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540006
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540007
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540008
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540009
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540010
    m_Localized: ...But somehow, it isn't fun.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540011
    m_Localized: "\u201CFinished\u201D and \u201Cfun\u201D are not the same thing."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540012
    m_Localized: You're right...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540013
    m_Localized: Map generator complete.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540014
    m_Localized: I rebuilt the entire system too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540015
    m_Localized: So I don't need to make stages anymore?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540016
    m_Localized: What...? Do I have to redraw everything?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540017
    m_Localized: Do I have to make different music for every stage too?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540018
    m_Localized: W-Wait a second!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540019
    m_Localized: I can make the stages myself...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540020
    m_Localized: No. First, I'm changing the design.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540021
    m_Localized: What...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540022
    m_Localized: We're never going to finish...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540023
    m_Localized: No, we're not going to finish...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540024
    m_Localized: ...Sorry. We're out of time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540025
    m_Localized: ...We went too far.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540026
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540027
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540028
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540029
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540030
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540031
    m_Localized: Well?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540032
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540033
    m_Localized: It's not fun.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540034
    m_Localized: ...Yeah.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540035
    m_Localized: The music feels completely out of place.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540036
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540037
    m_Localized: Delete it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540038
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540039
    m_Localized: Let's delete it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540040
    m_Localized: Oh.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540041
    m_Localized: Wait.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540042
    m_Localized: I die again the instant I restart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540043
    m_Localized: Ah.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540044
    m_Localized: It's a softlock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540045
    m_Localized: It saved right on top of the spikes...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540046
    m_Localized: We accidentally made a horror game where you die forever.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540047
    m_Localized: I didn't see that coming...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540048
    m_Localized: ...This is my fault as the person in charge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540049
    m_Localized: Well... haha...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540050
    m_Localized: Let's add more!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540051
    m_Localized: Then I'll add more characters!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540052
    m_Localized: I'll make three more tracks!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540053
    m_Localized: Sounds great!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540054
    m_Localized: Let's just change the whole spec!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540055
    m_Localized: Huh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540056
    m_Localized: Forget what we just decided! This is no longer a game! It's art!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540057
    m_Localized: That's going a little too far...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540058
    m_Localized: I'm in!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540059
    m_Localized: Let's do it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540060
    m_Localized: Wait, Got...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540061
    m_Localized: Yep. It's too late.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540062
    m_Localized: ...Perfect.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540063
    m_Localized: No bugs!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540064
    m_Localized: We finished all the assets in time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540065
    m_Localized: The music and sound effects are all implemented and checked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540066
    m_Localized: Thank you for checking every last detail!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540067
    m_Localized: They played all the way to the end...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540068
    m_Localized: I'm glad they got to see everything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540069
    m_Localized: This game was genuinely fun from beginning to end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540070
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540071
    m_Localized: Thank you so much, everyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540072
    m_Localized: I had a great time!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540073
    m_Localized: I never knew game jams could be this much fun.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540074
    m_Localized: I'd love to do this again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540075
    m_Localized: ...Yeah.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540076
    m_Localized: Next time, let's make something even better.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540077
    m_Localized: ...Of course!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540078
    m_Localized: Clear!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540079
    m_Localized: Huh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540080
    m_Localized: Huh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540081
    m_Localized: Huh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540082
    m_Localized: A no-death clear?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540083
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540084
    m_Localized: Now that's a developer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540085
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540086
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540087
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540088
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540089
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540090
    m_Localized: This is hopeless.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540091
    m_Localized: You've seen everything there is to see.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540092
    m_Localized: Thank you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540093
    m_Localized: You may already know this, but...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540094
    m_Localized: There is no single right answer in game development.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540095
    m_Localized: No one person is to blame.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540096
    m_Localized: There is no perfect way to give directions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540097
    m_Localized: When it comes to implementation...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540098
    m_Localized: ...or worldbuilding...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540099
    m_Localized: ...there is more than one answer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540100
    m_Localized: And...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540101
    m_Localized: the right answer...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540102
    m_Localized: doesn't belong to you alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540103
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540104
    m_Localized: I think that's all I need to say.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540105
    m_Localized: If you've played this far...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540106
    m_Localized: I'm sure you'll become a great game planner.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540107
    m_Localized: And finally...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540108
    m_Localized: Thank you for playing all the way to the end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 443540109
    m_Localized: Thank you for playing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
